SUMMARY:Chris D'Elia LIVE at Brea Improv (Saturday Show)
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Chris D’Elia\nChris D’Elia is one of the most in-demand stand-up comedians working today. Known for his high-energy performances\, razor-sharp wit\, and fearless crowd work\, D’Elia has built a massive following through his Netflix specials — including Man on Fire (2017)\, Incorrigible (2015)\, and his appearance in Netflix’s Comedians of the World series. His debut special White Male\, Black Comic premiered on Comedy Central in 2013. Beyond stand-up\, D’Elia is a beloved podcast host — his show Congratulations with Chris D’Elia has been a top comedy podcast on iTunes since 2017. He’s also a co-star on The Golden Hour with Brendan Schaub. \nWhat to Expect\nA Chris D’Elia show is an experience unlike any other. Expect rapid-fire delivery\, hilarious personal stories\, and spontaneous crowd interaction that keeps the entire room on edge. D’Elia’s comedy blends self-deprecating humor with bold observations about relationships\, pop culture\, and everyday life. His energy is electric — he rarely stays still on stage — and his ability to improvise and riff with the audience makes every show feel completely unique. Saturday night at the Brea Improv means a packed house and an electric atmosphere. This is a 21+ event\, so expect a mature\, no-holds-barred performance. \nAbout Brea Improv\nThe Brea Improv is one of Southern California’s premier comedy clubs\, located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, CA — just 30 miles southeast of downtown Los Angeles. Part of the nationally renowned Improv Comedy Club chain\, the Brea location features an intimate showroom with general admission seating\, premium booths\, and a full food and beverage menu. The club has a mandatory two-item minimum per guest in the showroom\, making it a true dinner-and-a-show experience. With its cozy atmosphere and excellent sightlines\, every seat feels close to the stage. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\, 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nTicket Prices: $35 – $100 (plus fees)\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/chris-delia-live-at-brea-improv-saturday-show/
LOCATION:Brea Improv\, 180 South Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA\, 92821\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://i.ticketweb.com/i/00/13/37/45/93_Edp.jpg?v=4
GEO:33.9183365;-117.8988084
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Brea Improv 180 South Brea Blvd Brea CA 92821 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=180 South Brea Blvd:geo:-117.8988084,33.9183365
END:VEVENT
