SUMMARY:GenX Takeover Comedy Tour LIVE at Route 66 Casino
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performers\nThe GenX Takeover Comedy Tour is a powerhouse comedy showcase celebrating the humor\, nostalgia\, and irreverence of Generation X. This touring comedy event brings together some of the funniest voices from the Gen X era\, delivering a night of laughs that resonates with anyone who grew up in the 80s and 90s. \nThe tour features comedians who draw on shared cultural touchstones — from Saturday morning cartoons and mixtapes to dial-up internet and the golden age of MTV. The humor is sharp\, self-aware\, and packed with the kind of references that will have Gen X audiences laughing in recognition. \nWhether you’re a card-carrying Gen Xer or just appreciate great stand-up comedy\, this show delivers an unforgettable night of entertainment that bridges generations through laughter. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM MDT\nVenue: Route 66 Casino\nAddress: 14500 Central Ave SW\, Albuquerque\, NM 87121\nTicket Prices: Starting at $35+\nAge Restrictions: 21+ (casino property); content intended for mature audiences\n\nAbout the Venue\nRoute 66 Casino is one of Albuquerque’s most iconic entertainment destinations\, located just west of the city along historic Route 66. The casino’s entertainment venue offers a fantastic atmosphere for live comedy\, with excellent sightlines\, comfortable seating\, and a lively crowd that knows how to have a good time. \nThe Route 66 Casino entertainment center has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and music\, making it a go-to destination for top-tier live entertainment in New Mexico. The venue features full bar service\, casino gaming before and after the show\, and ample free parking on-site. \nThe casino is located at 14500 Central Ave SW\, approximately 15 miles west of downtown Albuquerque. It’s easily accessible via I-40 and offers a full resort experience with dining\, gaming\, and entertainment all under one roof. \nWhat to Expect\nThe GenX Takeover Comedy Tour is a multi-comedian showcase format\, meaning you’ll get a full evening of comedy from several performers rather than a single headliner. Expect a rotating lineup of hilarious comedians who each bring their own unique perspective on Gen X life and culture. \nThe show runs approximately 2 hours and features a mix of storytelling\, observational humor\, and crowd interaction. It’s a perfect night out for groups of friends\, couples\, or anyone looking for a great time at one of Albuquerque’s premier entertainment venues. \nArrive early to grab drinks\, explore the casino floor\, and find your seats before the show begins. The Route 66 Casino entertainment venue fills up for popular shows\, so plan to arrive at least 30 minutes before showtime. \nTicket Information\nTicket Prices: Starting at $35+ (prices vary by section; VIP options available) \nPurchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets through VividSeats. Both options offer buyer protection and guaranteed delivery. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/genx-takeover-comedy-tour-live-at-route-casino/
LOCATION:Route 66 Casino\, 14500 Central Ave SW\, Albuquerque\, New Mexico\, 87121\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2ad9d929-1561-4315-ab85-25c4691c5549_CUSTOM-T5PIHq.jpg
GEO:35.0289546;-106.9513554
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Route 66 Casino 14500 Central Ave SW Albuquerque New Mexico 87121 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=14500 Central Ave SW:geo:-106.9513554,35.0289546
END:VEVENT
