SUMMARY:Seth Meyers: Live LIVE at The Colosseum at Caesars Windsor
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nSeth Meyers: Live LIVE at The Colosseum at Caesars Windsor\nLate Night with Seth Meyers host and SNL veteran Seth Meyers brings his acclaimed stand-up comedy to The Colosseum at Caesars Windsor\, just across the river from Detroit. Known for his sharp political wit\, incisive commentary\, and brilliant comedic writing\, Seth Meyers delivers a live stand-up experience that goes beyond the desk. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: The Colosseum at Caesars Windsor\nAddress: 377 Riverside Drive East\, Windsor\, ON\, Canada\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome\nNote: Valid passport or travel document required for border crossing \nAbout Seth Meyers\nSeth Meyers is the host of Late Night with Seth Meyers on NBC and a former head writer and Weekend Update anchor on Saturday Night Live. One of the sharpest comedic minds in the business\, Meyers is celebrated for his political humor\, pop culture commentary\, and masterful comedic timing. His live stand-up shows offer fans a rare chance to see him perform outside the Late Night studio. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp political wit and incisive social commentary\nStand-up material from one of TV’s funniest minds\nA rare live performance from the Late Night host\nAn intimate casino showroom experience\nEasy access from Detroit via the Ambassador Bridge or tunnel\nCasino dining and entertainment before the show\n\nVenue Information\nThe Colosseum at Caesars Windsor is a world-class entertainment venue located at 377 Riverside Drive East in Windsor\, Ontario\, directly across the Detroit River from downtown Detroit. \nTicket Information\nTickets from $135. Available via Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). Valid travel documents required for border crossing. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/seth-meyers-live-at-the-colosseum-at-caesars-windsor/
LOCATION:The Colosseum at Caesars Windsor\, 377 Riverside Dr E\, Windsor\, ON\, N9A 7H7\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/639/c860f8e9-1fb4-48a9-981f-607b28429639_SOURCE
GEO:42.3200781;-83.0336202
