SUMMARY:Danae Hays LIVE at IP Casino Resort and Spa
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nDanae Hays LIVE at IP Casino Resort and Spa\nCountry comedy sensation Danae Hays is bringing her wildly popular BUCKWILD Tour to the IP Casino Resort and Spa in Biloxi\, MS! Known for her hilarious Southern humor and viral social media videos\, Danae delivers a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud performance that will have the whole crowd going BUCKWILD. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: IP Casino Resort and Spa (Studio A)\nAddress: 850 Bayview Ave\, Biloxi\, MS 39530\nPhone: (228) 436-3000 \nAbout Danae Hays\nDanae Hays is a viral comedian and social media star whose hilarious videos about Southern life\, country culture\, and everyday absurdity have earned her millions of fans. Her authentic\, high-energy style translates perfectly to the live stage\, making every show an unforgettable experience full of big laughs and Southern charm. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy with Danae Hays’ signature country flair\nHilarious material from The BUCKWILD Tour\nA rowdy\, fun Saturday night atmosphere on the Gulf Coast\nLive performance from one of social media’s most beloved comedians\nGreat entertainment at the IP Casino Resort and Spa in Biloxi\n\nVenue Information\nIP Casino Resort and Spa is located at 850 Bayview Ave in Biloxi\, MS\, offering a full resort experience with casino gaming\, dining\, and a premier entertainment venue right on the Gulf Coast. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $75. Grab your seats now before this show sells out! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/danae-hays-live-at-ip-casino-resort-and-spa/
LOCATION:IP Casino Resort and Spa\, 850 Bayview Ave\, Biloxi\, MS\, 39530\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/bd1f8884-7d0b-4157-8ccb-22d5b7c3db65_CUSTOM-0C3zGd.jpg
