SUMMARY:Brian Regan LIVE at Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nBrian Regan is one of the most beloved and respected stand-up comedians in America — a master of clean\, brilliantly crafted observational comedy that has earned him a devoted following spanning generations. Known for his elastic facial expressions\, impeccable timing\, and ability to find hilarity in the most mundane moments of everyday life\, Brian Regan is widely regarded as a comedian’s comedian. \nWith multiple acclaimed stand-up specials including On the Rocks (Netflix)\, Nunchucks and Flamethrowers\, and Standing Up\, Brian has proven time and again that great comedy doesn’t need to be edgy to be brilliant. His shows are a masterclass in the art of stand-up — perfectly constructed bits delivered with the kind of physical comedy and vocal range that few performers can match. \nThis one-night-only performance at the Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort is a rare Las Vegas appearance from one of comedy’s true legends. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 9:00 PM\nVenue: Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort\nAddress: 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nNote: One night only\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort is one of Las Vegas’s premier mid-size entertainment venues\, located inside the iconic Venetian Resort at 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd. Seating approximately 1\,800 guests\, the theater is celebrated for its excellent acoustics\, clear sightlines from every seat\, and intimate atmosphere that makes every comedy show feel personal. \nThe Palazzo Theatre has become one of Las Vegas’s go-to destinations for world-class stand-up comedy\, hosting legends like Brian Regan\, Mark Normand\, Iliza Shlesinger\, and many more. Its layout ensures that whether you’re in the front row or the back\, you’ll have a great view of the stage. \nValet and self-parking are available at The Venetian Resort. The resort offers world-class dining\, shopping\, and casino entertainment\, making it easy to build a full Las Vegas evening around the show. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performance by Brian Regan — one night only at the Palazzo Theatre. The show runs approximately 90 minutes and features Brian’s signature observational humor\, delivered with the physical comedy\, vocal range\, and comedic precision that have made him one of the most acclaimed stand-up comedians of his generation. \nBrian Regan’s live shows are known for their warmth\, intelligence\, and the sheer joy of watching a true craftsman at work. His comedy is accessible to all ages and backgrounds\, making this a perfect show for date nights\, family outings\, or any comedy fan looking for a truly great night out. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $84 – $300 \nTickets available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Grab your seats before they sell out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/brian-regan-live-palazzo-theatre-venetian-las-vegas-july/
LOCATION:Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort\, 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/dc4/dbeb6a1f-d197-434f-a482-dfadf5df6dc4_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
GEO:36.1205928;-115.1685247
