SUMMARY:Damon Williams LIVE at Milwaukee Improv (Main Room)
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nDamon Williams LIVE at Milwaukee Improv (Main Room)\nGet ready for a hilarious night of stand-up comedy as Damon Williams takes the stage at Milwaukee Improv (Main Room) in Brookfield\, Wisconsin. Known for his sharp wit and relatable storytelling\, Damon Williams delivers a high-energy performance that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, July 12\, 2026\nTime: 6:00 PM CDT\nVenue: Milwaukee Improv (Main Room)\nAddress: 20110 Lower Union Street\, Brookfield\, WI 53045\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid photo ID required)\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase per person in the showroom. No photography or recording during the show. \nAbout Damon Williams\nDamon Williams is a seasoned stand-up comedian known for his energetic performances and sharp observational humor. He has performed at comedy clubs and venues across the country\, building a loyal fanbase with his authentic and hilarious take on everyday life. His charismatic stage presence and quick wit make every show an unforgettable experience. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of stand-up comedy from a seasoned performer\nSharp observational humor and relatable storytelling\nHigh-energy performance in an intimate club setting\nFull bar and food service available throughout the show\nGeneral admission seating (first-come\, first-served)\nAn unforgettable night of laughs in Brookfield\, WI\n\nVenue Information\nMilwaukee Improv (Main Room) is located at 20110 Lower Union Street in Brookfield\, Wisconsin\, just outside Milwaukee. The venue offers a classic comedy club atmosphere with full bar and dining service\, making it the perfect spot for a night out. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $26.22 and go up to $80.58. Secure your seats now before they sell out! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/damon-williams-live-at-milwaukee-improv-main-room/
