SUMMARY:Sammy Obeid LIVE at Howlin' Wolf
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nSammy Obeid LIVE at Howlin’ Wolf\nComedian Sammy Obeid brings his acclaimed stand-up show to the iconic Howlin’ Wolf in New Orleans on July 12\, 2026. Known for his sharp wit and unique perspective\, Sammy delivers a night of non-stop laughs you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, July 12\, 2026\nTime: 6:00 PM CDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Howlin’ Wolf\nAddress: 907 South Peters\, New Orleans\, LA 70130\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required) \nAbout Sammy Obeid\nSammy Obeid is a Lebanese-American stand-up comedian and actor known for his record-breaking 1\,001 consecutive nights of stand-up comedy. He has appeared on NBC’s Last Comic Standing\, Conan\, and has toured extensively across the country\, earning a reputation for his clever\, high-energy performances. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a nationally recognized comedian\nSharp observational humor and personal storytelling\nAn intimate venue experience at the legendary Howlin’ Wolf\nPresented by Laugh Life Comedy\n18+ show — bring valid photo ID\nDoors open at 5:30 PM\, show starts at 6:00 PM\n\nVenue Information\nHowlin’ Wolf is one of New Orleans’ most beloved live entertainment venues\, located at 907 South Peters in the heart of the city. Known for its intimate atmosphere and world-class acoustics\, it’s the perfect setting for a night of comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced at $41.41. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets on VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sammy-obeid-live-at-howlin-wolf/
