SUMMARY:Jeff Allen LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Jeff Allen\nJeff Allen is one of America’s most beloved comedians\, with nearly 1 billion online views and a record-setting seven Dry Bar Comedy specials to his name. Known for his warm\, family-friendly humor and his signature Happy Wife Happy Life routine\, Jeff has built a massive following across generations of comedy fans. \nAt 69 years old\, Jeff Allen is embarking on his My First Final Farewell Tour — a tongue-in-cheek nod to the fact that he’s not quite ready to hang up the microphone. The tour blends fan-favorite material with fresh new content\, delivering a night that is hilarious\, heartfelt\, and deeply uplifting. \nJeff has been featured on America’s Got Talent\, The Today Show\, Comedy Central\, and Showtime\, and starred in the films Apostles of Comedy and My 7 Grandmas. With millions of followers across Facebook\, Instagram\, TikTok\, and YouTube\, Jeff Allen is a comedy institution — but nothing compares to seeing him live. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, July 12\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:00 PM CDT\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nTicket Prices: $35 – $45 (plus fees) \nAbout the Venue\nThe Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and only minutes from the airport. The intimate club setting creates an electric atmosphere where every seat feels close to the action. \nThe venue features tiered seating sections including Preferred center-stage tables and General Admission side-stage tables — all first come\, first served within each section. The full-service bar lounge is the perfect place to grab a drink before the show\, and the two-item food or beverage minimum per person ensures a full dining experience during the performance. \nWith a capacity designed for an intimate comedy experience\, the Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club delivers a close-up\, personal show environment that larger arenas simply can’t match. Parking is available in the Park North Plaza lot. The venue enforces an 18% service charge on all checks in the showroom. \nWhat to Expect\nJeff Allen’s live show is a warm\, hilarious\, and uplifting experience that resonates with audiences of all ages. His comedy draws from real life — marriage\, family\, faith\, and the beautiful chaos of everyday existence — delivered with the kind of masterful timing that only comes from decades on the road. \nThis is a solo headlining performance as part of Jeff’s My First Final Farewell Tour. Expect a mix of beloved classics like Happy Wife Happy Life alongside fresh new material. The intimate setting of the Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club makes this an especially personal and memorable experience. \nPlease note this is an 18+ event. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges. A two-item food or beverage minimum per person applies once seated. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $35 – $45 per ticket (plus fees)\nPreferred Seating (center stage): $45 (+fees)\nGeneral Admission (side stage): $35 (+fees) \nJeff Allen’s shows are beloved by fans nationwide — don’t miss your chance to see him live in San Antonio! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jeff-allen-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX\, 78216\, USA
