SUMMARY:Russell Peters LIVE at Wind Creek Event Center
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nRussell Peters LIVE at Wind Creek Event Center\nOne of the world’s most celebrated stand-up comedians\, Russell Peters\, brings his highly anticipated Relax World Tour to the Wind Creek Event Center in Bethlehem\, PA on Sunday\, July 12\, 2026. Known for his razor-sharp observational humor and electrifying stage presence\, Russell Peters delivers a comedy experience unlike any other — don’t miss this unforgettable night of laughter in the Lehigh Valley! \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, July 12\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM EDT\nVenue: Wind Creek Event Center\nAddress: 77 Sands Blvd.\, Bethlehem\, PA 18015\nParking: Available on-site at Wind Creek Bethlehem\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome \nAbout Russell Peters\nRussell Peters is a Canadian stand-up comedian and actor who has become one of the most successful comedians in the world\, selling out arenas across six continents. Known for his sharp wit\, cultural observations\, and fearless comedy style\, Peters has released multiple Netflix specials and has performed for audiences of over 10\,000 people worldwide. His Relax World Tour continues to break attendance records globally. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA world-class stand-up comedy performance from one of the biggest names in comedy\nRussell Peters’ signature observational humor and cultural commentary\nAn arena-scale show with top production values and lighting\nMaterial from his acclaimed Relax World Tour\nA high-energy performance that will have the entire audience in stitches\nOne of the most anticipated comedy events of the summer in the Lehigh Valley\n\nVenue Information\nWind Creek Event Center is a premier entertainment venue located at 77 Sands Blvd. in Bethlehem\, PA\, adjacent to Wind Creek Bethlehem casino and resort. The state-of-the-art facility hosts world-class concerts\, comedy shows\, and sporting events\, with ample parking and full amenities on-site. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Russell Peters at Wind Creek Event Center are available now. Resale tickets start at $92. Secure your seats early as this show is expected to sell out. Tickets are non-refundable unless the event is cancelled or postponed. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
