SUMMARY:J.Chris Newberg LIVE at Laugh Factory Las Vegas
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJ.Chris Newberg is a uniquely talented comedian and musician who blends stand-up comedy with original songs to create a one-of-a-kind live experience. Known for his quick wit\, clever wordplay\, and infectious energy\, Newberg has built a devoted following through his hilarious musical comedy performances. \nHis shows are a seamless mix of sharp observational humor and original comedic songs that leave audiences laughing and singing along. J.Chris has performed at comedy clubs and festivals across the country\, earning a reputation as one of the most entertaining and versatile performers on the circuit. His ability to improvise and connect with audiences makes every show feel fresh and spontaneous. \nCatching J.Chris Newberg at the Laugh Factory in Las Vegas is a must for fans of comedy that goes beyond the ordinary — expect laughs\, music\, and an unforgettable night of entertainment. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Monday\, July 13\, 2026 (runs through July 19)\nTime: 8:30 PM\nVenue: Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas is a legendary comedy destination on the Las Vegas Strip. Part of the world-famous Laugh Factory brand\, this venue brings top-tier stand-up comedy to the heart of Las Vegas inside the iconic Horseshoe Hotel and Casino at 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd. \nThe club offers an intimate setting with tiered seating\, full bar service\, and excellent sightlines from every seat. The classic comedy club atmosphere makes it one of the best places in Las Vegas to experience live stand-up comedy. With multiple shows per week featuring rotating headliners\, the Laugh Factory is a go-to destination for comedy fans visiting the Strip. \nParking is available at the Horseshoe Las Vegas parking garage. The venue is easily accessible from the Strip and surrounding hotels. \nWhat to Expect\nJ.Chris Newberg’s Las Vegas residency at the Laugh Factory is a multi-night engagement featuring his signature blend of stand-up comedy and original musical comedy. Each show is a high-energy\, laugh-filled experience that combines the best of both worlds — sharp comedy writing and live musical performance. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and may include an opening act. Newberg’s ability to read the room and adapt his material ensures that every performance feels unique. Whether you’re a longtime fan or seeing him for the first time\, you’re in for a genuinely entertaining evening. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $55 (fees may apply) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official). Book early — Laugh Factory shows sell out fast! \nOfficial Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jchris-newberg-live-at-laugh-factory-las-vegas/
