SUMMARY:"Weird Al" Yankovic: Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour LIVE at Providence Performing Arts Center
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \n“Weird Al” Yankovic: Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour LIVE at Providence Performing Arts Center\nThe legendary “Weird Al” Yankovic brings his spectacular Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour to the Providence Performing Arts Center on July 14\, 2026. The undisputed king of comedy music returns with an extravagant live show featuring his greatest parody hits\, original songs\, and jaw-dropping costume changes. \nEvent Details\nDate: Tuesday\, July 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Providence Performing Arts Center\nAddress: 220 Weybosset Street\, Providence\, RI 02903\nAge Requirement: All Ages\nTicket Prices: Starting at $208 \nAbout “Weird Al” Yankovic\n“Weird Al” Yankovic is the best-selling comedy recording artist of all time\, with 5 Grammy Awards and over 12 million albums sold worldwide. Known for iconic parodies like “Eat It\,” “Amish Paradise\,” and “White & Nerdy\,” Weird Al has been entertaining audiences for over four decades. His 2022 biopic “Weird: The Al Yankovic Story” introduced him to a whole new generation of fans. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA spectacular full-production live show with elaborate costumes\nClassic parody hits and beloved original songs\nMultiple costume changes and theatrical set pieces\nAll-ages family-friendly entertainment\nOne of the most unique and entertaining live shows in music and comedy\nA night of pure joy and laughter at the beautiful PPAC\n\nVenue Information\nThe Providence Performing Arts Center (PPAC) is Rhode Island’s premier entertainment venue\, located at 220 Weybosset Street in downtown Providence. The stunning 3\,200-seat theater is one of the largest performing arts centers in New England and offers a world-class experience for every performance. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $208 and are available now. This is an all-ages event. Purchase official tickets through PPAC/Ticketmaster or find resale tickets on VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/weird-al-yankovic-bigger-weirder-tour-live-at-providence-performing-arts-center/
LOCATION:Providence Performing Arts Center\, 220 Weybosset Street\, Providence\, RI\, 2903\, USA
